{"sections":[{"slug":"中山引理","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"中山引理"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中山引理</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"中山引理"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">中山引理</span></strong> (Nakayama lemma) <span lang=\"zh\">说的是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/拟凝聚层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">拟凝聚层</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">在</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/局部环","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">局部</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的一些信息能由一点上的信息</span> ("},{"Local":{"url":"/纤维函子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">纤维函子</span>"}},{"Plain":") <span lang=\"zh\">决定</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">陈述</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">一个较强的引理</span></h3>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">结论</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $R$ <span lang=\"zh\">是交换环</span>, $I\\subset R$ <span lang=\"zh\">是理想</span>, $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">个元素生成的</span> $R$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">那么对任意同态</span> $f\\colon M\\to IM$, <span lang=\"zh\">存在</span> $a_1,\\cdots,a_n\\in I$ <span lang=\"zh\">使得</span>\n$$\r\nf^n + a_1 f^{n-1} + \\cdots + a_n = 0.\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">这个结论是</span> Cayley–Hamilton <span lang=\"zh\">定理的直接应用</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">考虑</span> $f=\\mathrm{id}$, <span lang=\"zh\">得到如下结论</span>.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">结论</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $R$ <span lang=\"zh\">是交换环</span>, $I\\subset R$ <span lang=\"zh\">是理想</span>, $M$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">个元素生成的</span> $R$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span>, $IM = M$. <span lang=\"zh\">那么存在</span> $a\\in I$ <span lang=\"zh\">使得</span>\n$$\r\n(1+a) M = 0.\r\n$$</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">特例</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">局部环与纤维</span></h3>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $R$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/局部环","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">局部环</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">极大理想为</span> $\\mathfrak m$, <span lang=\"zh\">剩余域为</span> $k= R/\\mathfrak m$. <span lang=\"zh\">对于有限生成</span> $R$-<span lang=\"zh\">模</span> $M$, <span lang=\"zh\">若</span> $M / \\mathfrak m M = 0$ (<span lang=\"zh\">即</span> $M\\otimes_R k$ = 0), <span lang=\"zh\">则</span> $M = 0$. <span lang=\"zh\">换言之</span>, "},{"Local":{"url":"/纤维函子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">纤维函子</span>"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{Mod}(R)_{\\mathrm{fg}} \\to \\mathsf{Vect}_{k}\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">保守</span>.</p>\n<p><em><span lang=\"zh\">证明</span></em>. <span lang=\"zh\">若</span> $M / \\mathfrak m M = 0$, <span lang=\"zh\">则</span> $M = \\mathfrak m M$, <span lang=\"zh\">而</span> $1 + \\mathfrak m \\subset R^\\times$, <span lang=\"zh\">故前述结论给出</span> $M=0$.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">拟凝聚层消失处为开集</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $F$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">概形</span>"}},{"Plain":" $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的局部有限生成</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/拟凝聚层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">拟凝聚层</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> “$F$ <span lang=\"zh\">消失之处</span>”\n$U_F\\colon\\mathsf{Aff}^{\\mathrm{op}}\\to\\mathsf{Set}$,\n$$\r\n\t\\operatorname{Spec} B\\mapsto \\{f\\colon \\operatorname{Spec} B\\to X\\mid f^*F\\simeq 0\\},\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">则</span> $U_F\\to X$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/开嵌入","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">开子概形</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">事实上</span>, $U_F$ <span lang=\"zh\">是理想</span> $\\operatorname{Ann}(F)$ <span lang=\"zh\">对应的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/闭嵌入","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">闭子概形</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的补空间</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">等价的陈述</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $F$ <span lang=\"zh\">是概形</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的局部有限生成</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/拟凝聚层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">拟凝聚层</span>"}},{"Plain":".\n<span lang=\"zh\">若对于某个域</span> $k$ <span lang=\"zh\">以及态射</span> $f\\colon \\operatorname{Spec} k\\to X$ <span lang=\"zh\">有</span> $f^*F\\simeq 0$,\n<span lang=\"zh\">则存在仿射</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/开嵌入","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">开子概形</span>"}},{"Plain":" $j\\colon U\\to X$ <span lang=\"zh\">包含</span> $f$ (<span lang=\"zh\">即</span> $f$ <span lang=\"zh\">穿过</span> $U$), <span lang=\"zh\">使得</span> $j^*F\\simeq 0$.</p>\n"}]}}}]}